    {
      "id": "a23c8f9a8b1c4016",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 15,
      "width": 1290,
      "height": 21.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1373158607,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 239081664,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788329837726,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Every fallback dial is a self-redial (trySelfRedial) \u2014 not just cross-provider ones.",
      "rawText": "Every fallback dial is a self-redial (trySelfRedial) \u2014 not just cross-provider ones.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Every fallback dial is a self-redial (trySelfRedial) \u2014 not just cross-provider ones.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "aa153d94f605461b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 1290,
      "height": 130.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 53710185,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1592467582,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788329837726,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This diagram walks the provider: \"anthropic\" case below. A bare \"reuse primary\" fallback\n(no field set) takes the SAME path with no selection header. A fallback declaring\nupstreamDefinition (same provider, different backend) takes the SAME path too, but sets\nx-wso2-model-failover-upstream-definition instead of x-provider \u2014 read only by this\npolicy's own OnRequestBody, which applies an in-process UpstreamName redirect to it.\nThe client's model is located via requestModel (payload/header/queryParam/pathParam),\na systemParameter gateway-controller injects from the LlmProvider/LlmProxy template \u2014\nnot hardcoded to the JSON body, same convention model-round-robin already uses.",
      "rawText": "This diagram walks the provider: \"anthropic\" case below. A bare \"reuse primary\" fallback\n(no field set) takes the SAME path with no selection header. A fallback declaring\nupstreamDefinition (same provider, different backend) takes the SAME path too, but sets\nx-wso2-model-failover-upstream-definition instead of x-provider \u2014 read only by this\npolicy's own OnRequestBody, which applies an in-process UpstreamName redirect to it.\nThe client's model is located via requestModel (payload/header/queryParam/pathParam),\na systemParameter gateway-controller injects from the LlmProvider/LlmProxy template \u2014\nnot hardcoded to the JSON body, same convention model-round-robin already uses.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This diagram walks the provider: \"anthropic\" case below. A bare \"reuse primary\" fallback\n(no field set) takes the SAME path with no selection header. A fallback declaring\nupstreamDefinition (same provider, different backend) takes the SAME path too, but sets\nx-wso2-model-failover-upstream-definition instead of x-provider \u2014 read only by this\npolicy's own OnRequestBody, which applies an in-process UpstreamName redirect to it.\nThe client's model is located via requestModel (payload/header/queryParam/pathParam),\na systemParameter gateway-controller injects from the LlmProvider/LlmProxy template \u2014\nnot hardcoded to the JSON body, same convention model-round-robin already uses.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 13
    },
